WEBVTT

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:19.750
What a wonderful morning!

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.670
A dazzling sun! And a dazzling big sister!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:24.880
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.880
If you're the big sister, then learn
to wake up on your own in the mornings.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:32.460
Why are you acting embarrassed?

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:33.500
Bye.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.880
See you later!

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:39.290
Hey, Chino!

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:43.790
You'll be able to come this way with me
in just half a year!

00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:44.830
Huh?

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:48.460
I can't wait until we're in 
the same high school together!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.210
I haven't chosen which 
school I'm going to yet!

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:54.000
What?!

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.500
Then you should decide that right now!

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.500
Okay, go! Well? Have you made up your mind?

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.250
You know it's not that simple...

00:01:02.380 --> 00:01:03.580
Hurry or you'll be late.

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:07.250
Welcome come on! For real!

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.290
High school...

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:21.710
Kuruntto hitomawari hora dance dance

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:24.790
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance dance

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.460
Door wa doko? (Kocchi!)

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:31.130
Cup no naka e pyon (Tobikonjatte!)

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:34.290
Osora ni ukabeta mokomoko na kumo

00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:37.670
Jitsu wa ne amai no honto ni (uso desu!)

00:01:37.670 --> 00:01:40.750
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjaeba

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:43.880
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:50.000
Itsumademo yume miteitaitte 
(Arieru koto yori arienai koto)

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:56.040
Kangaete ashita ni tokimeite 
(Shiritai aji ga ippai desu)

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.630
Sugar yori cinnamon ga

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:02.500
Ki ni nari dashitara shinka no toki kamo

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.880
Atarashii basho ni (Yobareta?)

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:08.920
Yobaretara omoikitte tobimashou

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:11.920
(Notte notte tea cup de gungun sora tobeba)

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:14.130
(Notte notte coffee cup hai hai)

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:17.880
Kuruntto hitomawari hora 
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:21.130
Tenkuu cafeteria de dance 
dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:24.790
Door wa doko? Cup no naka desu

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:27.420
Mousou? Genjitsu? Docchi?

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:30.790
Docchidemo iinjanai kana (sokka)

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.790
Atama ni whip sarechatte (Fuwa fuwa)

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:39.920
Saa odottara (Mirai wa) kitto 
tanoshii kara (tonjaimasuka!)

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.420
Osora ni tea cup to coffee cup tonjatte

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.540
Dokodemo ikemasu ne isshoni!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:51.540
A high school...

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.210
...information fair?

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:54.250
Yeah!

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.460
I thought you two might 
be interested in coming.

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.830
You haven't decided which 
school to apply to, right?

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:04.540
But the high school you want to get into
is that really posh one, right?

00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:09.380
Salutations. Salutations. 
Salutations. Salutations.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:12.750
Salutations.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.170
Salutations.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.790
Salutations.

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:20.380
Salutations!

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:25.040
You're gonna end up with a case of
"Salutations Syndrome" for sure!

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:28.880
Oh, quit exaggerating. I'm 
not going to act like that.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:32.000
That school seems way 
too formal and strict...

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:35.500
The admissions are competitive,
the classes are pretty hard and there's a ton of exams.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.540
It just sounds like a nightmare!

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:39.960
You seem very familiar with it.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.080
Yeah, because Rize told 
us about it all before!

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:44.830
Did she really?

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:48.150
Well, I haven't decided on a school yet.

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:51.000
This might be a good chance to get 
some insight, so I'll join you.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.750
Wonderful!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.790
I was actually pretty nervous 
about going by myself.

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:59.790
Ugh, fine. I'll go with you guys.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.710
I've gotta make sure you don't fall prey
to "Salutations Syndrome."

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.000
Thanks so much, Maya!

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:09.080
Okay, I'll go submit the 
form to get permission!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:23.130
Jump Rope Game | Opera House | Comedy Club | Shaved Ice Shop |
Cafe | Takoyaki Shop | Crepe Shop | Haunted House

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:22.670
And so, the consensus is for us
to run a cafe at the Culture Festival.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:27.540
The director for this project will be Chiya,
who has actual experience working in a cafe.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.040
Crepe Shop
Cafe

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.960
The same goes for Cocoa,
who will be serving as vice-director.

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:32.420
Thanks!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.420
We'll do the very best we can.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:38.500
Yes! And since we've been put 
in charge of this project...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.290
...surrender and failure will not be allowed!

00:04:42.210 --> 00:04:43.630
This year's Culture 
Festival is going to be...

00:04:43.960 --> 00:04:45.330
...an all-out war!

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.670
You're blowing it out of proportion!

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:52.460
Culture Festival Event
Vote Totals

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:52.460
Haunted House

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:52.460
Cafe

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:52.460
Comedy Club

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:52.460
Shaved Ice Shop

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:52.460
Jump Rope Game

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:52.460
Sex Museum

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.790
Let's make it happen, Cocoa!

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.210
Sure thing, Chiya!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.460
Have no fear...

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:55.080
...the two of us will handle this!

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.080
Question!

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:02.000
Supposedly you two have experience, but I find it
difficult to imagine either of you actually working.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:07.580
It looks like some people
haven't seen us on the job before.

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:11.540
Well, let me tell you, Chiya's "triple platter wielding"
is the stuff of masters!

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.080
How is that relevant?!

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:14.830
And that's not all.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:19.460
The way Cocoa looks when she's sunbathing
is so striking that even customers compliment her for it!

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.790
That's just slacking off!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.080
Well?

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.170
Impressive, no?

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.500
More like awful!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:32.670
We're gonna make it into a super exciting cafe
that Chino will love!

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:36.000
That way she'll be convinced 
to come to our school!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:40.420
Oh, by the way! You did a great job
at moderating everyone back there!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.920
Keep it up, Culture Fest Director!

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:45.750
Chiya?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.830
Uh, I...

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:53.380
This is my first time being a leader,
I'm not sure I can make the event a success...

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:54.250
Chiya?!

00:05:54.710 --> 00:05:58.960
At this rate, I'm doomed to become
a terrible manager for Ama Usa An!

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.000
Chiya?!

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.130
I never thought there would 
be this much pressure!

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:09.750
There, there. We'll figure 
all of it out together.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:11.170
Sob, sob, sob, sob, sob, sob...

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:19.380
In order to prepare for my school's Culture Festival,
I'll be taking time off starting tomorrow!

00:06:19.380 --> 00:06:21.170
You seem really enthusiastic.

00:06:22.880 --> 00:06:24.380
Just you wait!

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.630
It's gonna be extra thrilling 
and extra fluffy!

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:29.210
What is your class doing?

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:31.210
A restaurant!

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.500
The local community is helping 
our school this year!

00:06:34.130 --> 00:06:38.210
They're gonna give us fruits and vegetables
grown in the town's farms!

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.290
Wow!

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.920
So there are going to be a lot of restaurants
at our Culture Festival.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:44.380
It almost sounds like a Harvest Festival.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.960
I wonder if it would be effective advertising
for Rabbit House to help as well.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.670
We can all wear Tippy hats or something!

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.790
That would be a great way to advertise!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:55.250
See if you can get permission!

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.880
In that case, we should just have
Tippy come to the classroom!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:06:59.750
What?!

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.000
I'm sure he'd be popular.

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:06.580
Why are they offering to provide me
instead of providing delicious coffee?!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:06.580
Then everybody can wear Tippy masks
and we'll become Tippy in both body and soul!

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:10.040
COME
AND
RELAX
Closed

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:16.790
Food that we can make at school, hm...
taking into account everyone's opinions...

00:07:20.170 --> 00:07:22.830
Being the director sure seems like a handful.

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:27.170
Considering the budget,
we'll definitely have to use cheaper curtains...

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.580
Hey. Let me see how it's coming along.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:34.630
No! This is top secret info
that I can only share with my class!

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:36.540
Boo!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.290
It looked like you turned
into a blowfish for a second there.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.830
Y-you're imagining things!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.250
Just focus on doing your best.

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:47.130
You're going on a guided tour
of Rize and Syaro's school?!

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.290
That sounds awesome. I wish I could go.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:53.880
Please just go to your own school.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:08:00.290
Say, how would you describe your school?

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:01.880
It's a blast!

00:08:01.880 --> 00:08:05.000
Super interesting and super fluffy!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.130
How can a school be fluffy?

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.290
Rize's school seems like it 
would be fun to attend, too.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.380
Oh no, what happens if you 
really like it there...?!

00:08:15.960 --> 00:08:18.880
I might just go ahead and 
take the entrance exam.

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.460
Oh my God!

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:25.830
My plan to enjoy high school life
with my little sister would be ruined...

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:30.170
B-but if that's the future you want
for yourself then... as your big sister...

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:36.750
Oh jeez! You're not allowed 
to tease me like that!

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:38.790
Uh-huh.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.170
Over here, you two!

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.880
Megu is really enjoying this.

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.920
She's pretty hyper.

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:59.080
Whoa, is this the castle 
where the final boss lives?!

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:01.790
I've never seen it this close up before.

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:03.630
Okay, let's go!

00:09:04.130 --> 00:09:07.380
Wow, she went for it! Megu is a real hero!

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:10.290
Yes, a hero disguised as a princess.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:15.830
I'm Rin Mate, an alumni.

00:09:16.130 --> 00:09:18.250
I'm currently employed at a publishing house.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:21.500
If I remember right, that 
lady is Miss Aoyama's...

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:23.630
At first, I thought this school would pose
too much of a challenge for me to get into.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:27.330
But thanks to a teacher's recommendation,
I was accepted as a scholarship student.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.080
Wow. A scholarship student, eh?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:31.290
However, I still felt nervous even 
after I formally entered the school.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:31.290
Shush!

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.580
I wasn't sure that I had what it took
to keep up with the other students.

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:39.210
But around that time,
I met with someone I never expected.

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:44.460
Meeting with new people allows us to discover
the hidden potential that lies within ourselves.

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:46.000
And that enables us to grow.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:53.540
My encounter with a certain senior here
at the school changed my life forever.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:55.420
That's why I know!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.330
New encounters are important!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.960
New encounters are important...

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.420
New encounters change lives...

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.880
That might actually be true.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.110
My life at school was 
commandeered by that senior,

00:10:12.110 --> 00:10:14.260
which provided me with a 
great deal of experience

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:17.380
and helped me to open a path to the future.

00:10:17.710 --> 00:10:18.960
Not only that...

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.130
Miss Aoyama?!

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:28.960
My life is still being 
commandeered by her even now!

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:32.380
If you see this person anywhere,
please contact me right away!

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:37.750
That was worthwhile, huh?

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:38.880
Yeah.

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:42.630
That was a nice speech.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:45.920
So that lady ended up working 
as Miss Aoyama's editor.

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.580
That's such a wonderful story.

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.170
All right! I'm going to 
get accepted here, too!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:54.710
Well, I'm definitely not cut 
out for all this formality.

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:56.540
Just being here sends shivers down my spine.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:59.250
You'll be fine once you get used to it!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.670
It can't be that simple...

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:05.170
It is! Give it a try, I'd love to see what you look like
pretending to be all ladylike!

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:07.790
Ladylike? That's not happening.

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:08.880
Please do it!

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:12.380
Seriously? Jeez, I guess if you insist.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:13.670
Here goes.

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:19.880
Why if it isn't my darlings! Sal-yo-tations!

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.500
Take this more seriously, yo.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.460
We don't need your jokes, yo.

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:28.670
This is exactly why I didn't wanna do it!

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:30.380
Alright, time to go home!

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:33.880
Oh, I'm going to swing by the restroom first.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.290
Um...

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:38.540
Wait for me over there, would you?

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.420
Megu sure is taking a long time.

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.830
I bet she stopped to look at some flowers
and then got lost chasing a butterfly!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.580
Waaait!

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:54.630
I mean, these school grounds are huge.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:56.830
That does sound like something Megu would do.

00:11:57.210 --> 00:11:58.880
Let's go look for her.

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.670
Wouldn't waiting here be better...?

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:06.630
Where did Mayu and Chino get off to?

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:10.040
Good grief, they always get lost.

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.210
I don't see Megu anywhere.

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.540
So, where are we now?

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:20.750
Going off to look for Megu but then
getting lost yourself is so you, Maya.

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:28.460
The Blow-dart Club is entering 
a big competition soon.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:29.170
Need my help?

00:12:29.170 --> 00:12:30.250
I know that voice.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:32.750
Do you mind, Rize?

00:12:32.750 --> 00:12:33.790
I'd love to help!

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:35.540
Hooray!

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:37.500
Please bring Syaro, too.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.420
Okay then, salutations.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.290
Later!

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:45.960
So many people rely on Rize. She's amazing.

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:48.540
Rize!

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:50.580
Megu?!

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.500
Salutations.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.500
S-salutations.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.540
No, wait, what are you doing here?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:13:00.040
Maya and Chino got lost around here!

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:00.960
Huh?

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.460
Shall we go to the library?

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:09.170
No sign of Megu.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:12.830
Yeah. Maybe she got trapped
in an underground labyrinth.

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.130
Oh, it's Syaro!

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:18.500
The sale starts at 5:30 and I 
took time off work just to go.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:21.130
So while I'm at it, I'll try 
for the 50% off evening sale...

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.000
Syaro! Have you seen Megu anywhere?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:24.170
No, I haven't.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:27.960
Hopefully I can get my hands
on some stuff that won't expire for a while... huh?

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:27.460
I guess she didn't come this way.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:30.580
Why are you two here?!

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:32.210
Syaro came back.

00:13:32.460 --> 00:13:33.380
If any of the teachers catch you...

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:34.670
We came here for the information fa-

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:36.080
Come on! This way!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:38.830
Hurry and change into these!

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:40.960
Um...

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:42.000
What's this?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.380
Just hurry up! It's a big deal
if you get caught trespassing!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.790
But we're not trespassing...

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.040
There was a guided tour...

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.420
I'll keep watch outside, so make it snappy!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.380
Do you think Syaro just 
doesn't know about the tour?

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.540
This is gonna be fun, so 
let's not say anything!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.830
But seriously, I just don't 
feel comfortable in this thing.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.330
Watch carefully. You'll need to mimic me.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.000
Stick your chest out and move with grace.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:37.960
Salutations.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:39.580
Salutations.

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.380
Salutations.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:44.290
Looking good, girls.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.210
You don't have to mimic that part!

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:50.380
Excuse me.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.920
Have you seen a girl with two pigtails
that look like tornadoes?

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.630
She's not the least bit shy, huh?

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:59.380
Probably because she's treating 
this like playing a game.

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:01.710
Chino! I did it!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.580
I thought they'd be way 
more difficult to talk to!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:05.960
What did you find out?

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:08.290
About that...

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.880
There's been no sightings of her
on the whole west side of the school.

00:15:11.880 --> 00:15:15.290
That's reliable info from a member of the student council
who's in charge of relaying news.

00:15:15.290 --> 00:15:18.210
How did you learn so much so quickly?!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:20.380
And they invited us to tea time!

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:22.290
Tea time?!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.710
Seriously...?

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:31.040
Excuse me. Would you kindly 
hand me that teacup?

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:32.290
Why yes, of course.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:35.710
This is the authentic, rich 
girl tea time experience.

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:35.710
These are freshly baked madeleines. 
Aren't they just delectable?

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:38.830
I have recently taken a strong 
interest in home cooking.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:41.500
Are there any ingredients
you could recommend to me, Maya?

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.500
Bean sprouts! They're easy to cook!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.710
"Bean sprouts"?

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:49.250
I've heard bean sprouts can be quite tasty
when stir fried with a dash of curry powder!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:51.540
You're such a wealth of knowledge, Syaro!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.040
What are "bean sprouts" exactly?

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:54.250
Hold it!

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:55.330
Objection!

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.790
They're far better in miso 
soup instead of stir fried!

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:01.170
But you can't enjoy their 
texture if you boil them.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.290
Boiled!

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:03.330
Stir fried!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:06.080
I'm siding with Syaro.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.290
I'm siding with Maya.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.580
So tell us, what are bean sprouts?

00:16:11.630 --> 00:16:14.710
The authentic... rich girl...

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:18.080
Rize's uniform is a little too big for me.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.580
But...

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:25.210
I'm so happy I already 
get to try wearing one!

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:26.460
Megu.

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:28.210
Y-yes?

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:32.750
Listen up. You've got to search for the others
without letting anyone know you're trespassing.

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:36.710
Rize clearly has the wrong idea,
but I don't want to ruin her fun.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:40.210
Commence your mission
just as if you'd infiltrated an enemy base!

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:41.960
Y-yes, sir!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:52.080
How did we end up participating
in the Ballroom Dance Club?

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:56.080
This could be considered another 
way of gathering intel.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.790
So...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.040
This school is shaping up to 
be more fun than I thought!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:07.580
You really do end up enjoying 
just about anything, huh?

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:13.290
Well, Chino, I guess we can't fully understand
some worlds until we dive right into them, huh?

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:14.830
Dive in...

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:18.040
I feel like I've gained a 
ton of experience points!

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:20.630
You're giving off an aura of elegance
just like Syaro does!

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:24.130
Salutations!

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:25.420
Salutations.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.170
S-salutations.

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:30.380
Nice! You're doing great.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:31.710
Yes, sir!

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:38.830
Huh? You want me to poke my eyes out...?

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:39.920
Look ahead!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.080
I have to act like a legitimate student here!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:46.540
A perfect performance!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.630
Salutations!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.000
Salutations.

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.710
Salutations!

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.500
Salutations!

00:17:56.130 --> 00:17:57.130
Huh?!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:01.750
You should have just said 
you were here on a tour!

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:03.790
We're sorry.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.080
I knew about it, but I totally spaced...

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.790
But today sure was full 
of thrills, right Maya?

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:14.140
Yeah... I was actually recommended for 
the scholarship exam at this school.

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.900
I might seriously consider taking it.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:16.790
Huh?

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:20.630
Very funny, quit joking around
and take your future a little more seriously!

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:23.170
I'm being 100% serious!

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:24.080
What?

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:27.210
One of our teachers recommended you?

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:29.960
That's news to me.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:33.460
Thinking about it, Maya actually
does get incredibly good grades.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:37.170
And although she tires of some things easily,
her curiosity to learn has always been strong.

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:41.960
Does that mean all of her stupidity up until now
was intentional just to mess with us...?

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.750
Th-the truth is that I didn't think
I would be comfortable here.

00:18:46.670 --> 00:18:47.500
But...

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:50.670
Are you sure all of the etiquette
and such won't bring you down?

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:53.210
I really struggled until 
I got used to it myself.

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:56.330
You just put too much 
pressure on yourself, Syaro!

00:18:56.540 --> 00:19:01.130
Besides, if I can come here for free,
then I think that would make it easier on my parents.

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:02.580
Maya...

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:04.170
Maya!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.880
If you come to this school,
I'll teach you a bunch of bean sprout recipes!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:10.710
I want you to give me 
better advice than that!

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:13.380
I've had some thoughts 
about this before, but...

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:16.130
you keep a lot of secrets from us, Maya.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:21.000
Even though you got a recommendation for this school,
you didn't mention a word of it to us.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.960
And there was that one time you ran off
to seek Rize's advice...

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.040
I remember that, too.

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:31.460
But we already know that underneath it all,
you're a very gentle and caring friend.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:32.630
That's true.

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:36.790
And we know all about how you
feel so lonely without us around.

00:19:37.460 --> 00:19:40.710
Rize! Make those two shut up!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.330
I know how you feel.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:45.330
Maya is seriously blushing up a storm!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.330
A rare sight.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:50.750
Oh hey! You should come
to this high school with us, Chino!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:53.000
You're just trying to shift 
attention away from yourself.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:57.630
Never mind that. I mean, you're not wrong,
but just imagine if you came to this school!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:58.750
Good point!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:00.580
Then we could stick together for sure!

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:06.290
Chimame Corps! Let's all 
say "salutations" together!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.080
Salutations!

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:11.210
Salutations!

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:16.000
The two of you are totally suffering
from Salutation Syndrome right now.

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:22.130
I bet our school lives would have been
just as rowdy if Cocoa and Chiya had attended with us.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:23.750
For sure.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.080
I get a headache just imagining 
what it would be lik-

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.080
Salutations!

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.630
These voices belong to...!
Salutations.

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.500
I hear some familiar voices nearby.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:31.460
And I see some familiar pigtails...

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.830
Rize? Syaro?

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.290
Salutations!

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.710
What are you doing here?

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:38.670
That's what we want to know!

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:41.290
Wait a second, those uniforms you have on...

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:43.700
We came to borrow some supplies 
for our Culture Festival

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.300
and became fast friends 
with the Garment Club.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.500
They let us wear them!

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:49.080
We get to be rich girls for the day!

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.380
Oh! It's Chino!

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:54.380
And Megu and Maya! You 
all have the uniform on!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:57.330
Everyone is fitting right in.

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:58.420
Yay!

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:00.290
We're all rich girls!

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.210
Yay!

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:04.670
There's nothing "yay" about it.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:06.380
Give me a break.

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:07.960
What are they doing?

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:09.880
Yay.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:14.420
Hey Rize, about what I said 
about Syaro earlier...

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:16.460
Thank you for always looking 
after our little Syaro.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:18.170
D-d-don't! Cut it out!

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:21.330
You're very welcome.

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:24.170
And our little Rize is 
such a darling, isn't she?

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:25.290
What are you, my mom?!

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:27.420
Indeed she is.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:30.670
We hope that you continue 
to stay in good graces...

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:33.170
...with our Syaro and Rize.

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.920
Of course.

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:36.250
Enough already!

00:21:36.250 --> 00:21:37.330
This is humiliating!

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.580
Please keep them in line.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:39.130
I said stop!

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:42.460
I think coming to this 
school will be really fun!

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:43.330
Yeah!

00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:50.670
High school, huh?

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:56.000
Bunnisode 3:
Everything in the World Serves as My Experience Points

00:21:56.500 --> 00:21:58.670
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:00.460
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:04.000
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:22:04.000 --> 00:22:07.830
Kono sekai ni wa fushigi ga aru to

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:11.630
Minareta mado kara osasoi no message

00:22:11.880 --> 00:22:15.670
Ironna toko e dekakemasen ka?

00:22:15.670 --> 00:22:19.380
Hai hai tama ni wa bouken mo hitsuyou desu ne

00:22:19.630 --> 00:22:23.250
Soshite soshite tooi machikado de kitto

00:22:23.540 --> 00:22:27.380
Itsumo no coffee nomitaku naru hazu

00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:33.380
Hanarete mite wakaru koto ga takusan aru

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:36.920
Yappari...

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:40.710
Ima wa issho ga ii ne zutto issho ga ii ne

00:22:40.960 --> 00:22:44.500
Kawatteku kisetsu no naka demo

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:48.500
Onaji kimochi de itai minna o daiji ni shitai

00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:52.540
Daisuki na basho ga atte yokatta

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:56.420
Ima wa issho ga ii ne sou da issho ga ii ne

00:22:56.540 --> 00:23:00.080
Dokoka ittemo chanto modotte kite

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:02.170
Tsutawatteru ki ga shimasu

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:07.500
Datte datte hora kyou mo minna ni aemashita

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:13.920
Aitai toki ni aerutte... nakayoshi!

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:17.960
Nakayoshi da zutto da!

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:19.460
Nakayoshi! Maru! Nakayoshi!

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:23.710
Kimecchaimasu Maru desukara mondai nai!!

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:29.880
Has Chino made up her mind
about high school yet? I'm worried.

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:31.670
Any uniform would look good, I think.

00:23:31.670 --> 00:23:34.330
I want to wear a blazer, myself!

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:36.040
Bunnisode 4: A Potential Everyday Life

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:35.830
I wasn't talking about you!
